HOW TO ANSWER TO INDEPENDENCIES COMMANDS
A command starting with “independencies”, “indep” or “idp” triggers this way of functioning.
"Owner, im independent now!"

(all further commands are sub commands of the independencies command)

on / enable: Ignores any form of dependency requested and installs plugins, extensions, or addons without the dependency as well as possible.
off / disable: Require and automatically install dependencies for plugins if a download is specified in the plugin file.

status / stat / current: Display the current state of independencies, so if its on or off.
